stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED
    CREATED --> RUNNING
    RUNNING --> WAITING: Waiting for data or human input
    WAITING --> RUNNING: Condition met / human resume
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED: Task complete
    RUNNING --> FAILED: Execution failed
    FAILED --> RUNNING: Recovery conditions met
    COMPLETED --> [*]
